OL,3,AHunt for attackers after Halloween
OL,4,Aparty stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are hunting for attackers who
OL,7,Fstabbed five teenage boys at a
OL,8,FHalloween party.
OL,10,FOfficers said they were called shortly
OL,11,Fafter 22:30 GMT on Saturday to Park
OL,12,FRoad in Chandler's Ford, Hampshire,
OL,13,Fwhere an "unknown group" had gained
OL,14,Fentry to the event.
OL,16,FThree boys aged 16 and two aged 17 were
OL,17,Ftaken to hospital with serious
OL,18,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
