OL,3,AFake nuclear warning from hacked app
OL,4,Asparks unease but not panic in Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkrainians have grown weary of the
OL,7,Frelentless alerts blaring from their
OL,8,Fphones and echoing through their
OL,9,Fstreets, day and night, warning of
OL,10,FRussian drones and missiles.
OL,12,FOn Sunday night, the system delivered
OL,13,Fsomething to make them sit up and take
OL,14,Fnote ` a succession of more extreme
OL,15,Fthreats that quickly escalated to
OL,16,Fimpending nuclear strikes, chemical
OL,17,Fattacks and combat on the streets.
OL,19,FBut many in the country did not take
OL,20,Fthem seriously and doubted the veracity
OL,21,Fof the messages.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
