OL,3,AUS officials give update on deadly
OL,4,AFlorida jet crash as reports name
OL,5,A20-year-old as copilot
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe National Transportation Safety
OL,8,FBoard (NTSB) gives an update after a
OL,9,Fjet crashed in Florida on Sunday,
OL,10,Fkilling all nine people on board
OL,12,FThe NTSB says two of those on board the
OL,13,FLearjet were flight crew and seven were
OL,14,Fpassengers
OL,16,FThey tell a news conference the plane
OL,17,Fbegan to descend less than 30 seconds
OL,18,Fafter the crew issued a mayday call
OL,20,FUS media have reported that one of the
OL,21,Fvictims was the plane's 20-year-old
OL,22,Fcopilot. Nobody on the ground was hurt
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
